The legal text is from the Laws of Grenada site (https://laws.gov.gd), the official publication of the Government of
Grenada: Cap. 128A, the Grenada Constitution Act (S.I. 2155 of 1973), retrieved 29 October 2026; Cap. 72A, the Criminal Code, and Cap. 58A, the Companies Act, retrieved 30 October 2026.
The site states no licence.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was converted to one Markdown file per section, appendix or schedule, line breaks within a
paragraph were joined, and typographic quotes were normalised. The wording of the law was not changed. The Government
of Grenada does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages and the tools) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
